description:
We are looking for AI/ML Consultants, who wants to work for the European Institutions in Brussels.




 We are looking for a senior IT consultant with at least 1 year of ML, NLP, AI experience with Python or Java in a cloud environment










 Candidates need to be based in Belgium or willing to relocate to Brussels when coming from abroad.










 EU candidates are welcome to apply. Work permit is not provided.










 This position is also open for employees and freelancers. Candidates need to be fluent in English.










**Tasks and responsibilities** 



* Develop and maintain software applications in Natural Language Processing (NLP), Machine Learning (ML), and Artificial Intelligence (AI);
* Design and optimize machine learning systems and deep learning architectures;
* Collaborate with cross\-functional teams to integrate AI/ML solutions into existing products and processes;
* Define and implement IT architectures for NLP, ML, and AI solutions, ensuring alignment with master and meta\-data management concepts;
* Perform data preprocessing, feature engineering, and model evaluation to enhance performance;
* Stay updated with the latest advancements in AI/ML technologies and algorithms;
* Maintain and support AI\-deployed solutions on SaaS platforms such as AWS and Azure;
* Document architecture blueprints and align them with business requirements;









**Profile:** 



* Master or Bachelor degree;
* \+13 years of general IT experience.
* \+1 year of experience with Large Language Models (LLMs), text embeddings, tokenization, vectorization, machine learning, and deep learning;
* \+1 year of experience with of Python/Java/Containers (Docker/Kubernetes)/Cloud AI services (AWS, Azure);
* \+1 year of experience in the full lifecycle of natural language processing (NLP) systems and agile software development methodologies;
* \+1 year of experience in quality assurance and quality control for machine translation (MT), and experience with MT quality procedures, testing methodologies and tools, such as automatic quality metrics (BLEU scores and similar) and human evaluation of MT quality;
* Proven ability to conduct proof of concepts (PoCs) efficiently and effectively;
* Strong presentation skills for both technical and business audiences;
* High attention to quality standards and the ability to work in fast\-evolving cloud\-based environments;
* Strong written communication skills for technical documentation;
* Ability to actively participate in technical discussions and collaborate with diverse stakeholders;
* Fluent in English;



 Desirable Certifications (one or more of the following certifications are preferred):



* AWS Certifications: AWS Certified Machine Learning, AWS Certified Data Analytics, AWS Certified Solutions Architect;
* Microsoft Certifications: Azure AI Engineer Associate, Azure Data Scientist Associate, Azure Solutions Architect Expert;

Job Description:

Are you a person with a passion for Artificial Intelligence? Are you interested in working in a multilingual, dynamic and friendly environment that encourages personal and professional development? We would love to meet you!


As a Lead Data Scientist, you’ll be responsible for ensuring all AI initiatives align with enterprise architecture standards, business strategy, and regulatory requirements. Operating within a SAFe Agile framework, you’ll provide deep architectural expertise, facilitate delivery across platforms, and support business value realization.

**What does your typical day look like?**

* Lead the end\-to\-end design and validation of AI solutions—whether developed in\-house or by third\-party vendors—ensuring alignment with enterprise architecture and business needs;
* Develop and operationalize an Agentic Framework for AI use cases to support modular, composable, and autonomous workflows;
* Translate business, functional, and non\-functional requirements into architectural blueprints and actionable implementation plans;
* Provide technical mentorship and architectural guidance to data scientists and engineers working on AI initiatives;
* Encourage architectural thinking, best practices, and code quality across cross\-functional AI efforts;
* Define integration patterns, orchestration workflows, and MLOps practices that support the seamless deployment of AI workloads across cloud\-native and containerized environments;
* Support Agile Release Trains and development teams by converting architectural strategy into features, enablers, and spikes.

**What skills and training do you need?**
=========================================

* Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, or a related technical field;
* 7–10 years of progressive experience in AI\-focused technical roles, including architecture, machine learning solution design, and deployment at scale;
* Proven experience designing and implementing AI/ML solutions in enterprise environments, with emphasis on modular, reusable architectures;
* Hands\-on experience with modern AI platforms and orchestration tools, including Dataiku for AI workflow development and Snowflake for cloud\-based data operations;
* Familiarity with containerized environments, model lifecycle management, and MLOps best practices;
* Experience managing and technically guiding a team of data scientists;
* Strong background in integrating and evaluating third\-party AI products and services;
* Agile/SAFe delivery experience in a cross\-functional, fast\-paced environment;
* Relevant certifications (e.g., Dataiku DSS, Snowflake SnowPro, Azure AI Engineer Associate, or MLOps tools) are considered strong assets;
* Bilingual (English required; French is an asset) to support global and regional collaboration.

**When you apply:**


If you require assistance or accommodation during our recruitment process, please notify Human Resources so that we can review and consider how we may be able to assist you based on your individual needs.


We offer you:
* Global Excel offers more than a position;
* We offer a professional future with a competitive compensation including base salary, performance bonus and benefits;
* Please reach out to your local HR department if you would like to know more about benefits offered in your site.

**To get a taste of the Global Excel life** **and for more information on** **our** **company****, visit our Facebook page** **and** **website****:**
